1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:04,517
Whoosh! The wind is strong in the valley today.

2
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:08,244
My red kite! It is flying away!

3
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:13,741
Hi, Pipkin! I am Brindle. What is wrong?

4
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:18,237
The wind took my kite. I can't see it now.

5
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:22,660
Pipkin feels sad. Brindle has an idea.

6
00:00:23,197 --> 00:00:27,434
Let's look for clues together. Kites follow the wind!

7
00:00:27,947 --> 00:00:32,401
The leaves are blowing toward the trees. That is a clue!

8
00:00:33,647 --> 00:00:38,004
Hello! Is that red kite yours? It is in my tree.

9
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:42,881
Yes! But it is so high. How can we get it?

10
00:00:43,405 --> 00:00:46,920
I am tall. Let me reach it, very gently.

11
00:00:47,447 --> 00:00:52,215
Up, up, up, and down. The kite is safe!

12
00:00:52,738 --> 00:00:56,666
Thank you, Oakley! Thank you, Brindle!

13
00:00:57,197 --> 00:01:01,294
When we help each other, big problems get smaller.

14
00:01:01,822 --> 00:01:04,629
What would you do if your kite flew away?
